      "title": "NOVAGOLD Announces Expected Completion Date for Donlin Gold Acquisition, NYSE Listing and TSX Delisting",
      "summary": "NOVAGOLD has obtained shareholder approval to acquire Paulson's 40% stake in Donlin Gold, consolidating 100% ownership of the Tier One gold project in Alaska. The transaction is expected to close on December 1, 2026, with a new U.S. parent company, NovaGold Corporation, listing on NYSE under ticker 'NG' on December 2. NOVAGOLD shares will delist from NYSE American and TSX following completion.",
